WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.215
Dear Sophie,

00:00:01.465 --> 00:00:13.533
My name is Lena and I am your new pen friend. I am fifteen and I live in Hamburg, in the north of Germany. Hamburg is very big and has a harbour.

00:00:13.783 --> 00:00:28.289
I have a brother. His name is Paul and he is nine. My father is a cook in a restaurant and my mother is a doctor. We also have a cat. She is called Mimi and sleeps all day.

00:00:28.539 --> 00:00:37.165
In my free time I like swimming and I read a lot. My favourite subject at school is English. I don't like maths so much.

00:00:37.415 --> 00:00:43.012
And you? Do you have brothers or sisters? What do you like doing? Write to me soon!

00:00:43.262 --> 00:00:45.071
Best wishes
Lena
